<h3><u>ROZE PE MUSTAFA KE UDASEE SI CHAAYI HAI</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>NANA AJEEB SAANAAE HAM PAR GUZAR GAYE, RANJ O ALAM NE GHER LIYAA HUM JIDHAR GAYE<br />
NANA KHUDAA KAI GHAR MEIN NA HUM KO AMAAN MILI, BHAI NE SHEHER CHOD KE JANGAL KI RAAH LI</p>

<p>NANA HAMAIN NA CHAIN MAYASSAR KAHIN HUA, PAANI BHI BANDH HUM PAI LAEENON NE KARDIYA</p>

<p>NANA TUMHARI AAL PAI KYA KYA SITAM HUE, BACHCHE TADAP KEI MAR GAYE PAANI KAI WAASTE</p>

<p>NANA SHAHEED HO GAYE BHAI KAI JAANNISAR, EK EK KAR KE MAR GAYE ASHAB E ZEEWAQAR<br />
NANA BALA KE BAN MAIN QAYAMAT KA RUN PADA, BHAYEE SAI BHAYEE BAAP SAI BETA BICHAD GAYA</p>

<p>NANA ZAMEEN E KARBOBALAA LAAL HO GAYI, QASIM KI LAASH GHODON SE PAAMAAL HO GAYI<br />
NANA KATAA KE SHAANON KO ABBAS MARGAYE, GHURBAT ME BHAAIJAAN KO BE AAS KARGAYE</p>

<p>NANA TUMHARI SHAKL KA FARZAND EK JO THA, KHAA KAR SINA JIGAR ME WO MEHRU BHI CHAL BASA<br />
NANA SHAQI KI TEER SE ASGAR HUA SHAHEED, AISA HUA NA HOGA JAHAAN MAIN SITAM SHADEED</p>

<p>NANA HUSSAIN BEKAS O BE YAAR HOGAYE, AAMADA QATL KARNE KO KUFFAR HOGAYE<br />
TADPE JO ZER KHANJARE BE AAB SHAAHE DEEN, SHIMRE LAEEN KE ZULM SE THARRA GAYI ZAMEEN</p>

<p>NANA HAMARE GHAR KA SAB ASBAAB LUT GAYA, NANA HAMARE SAR PE NA BAAQI RAHI RIDA<br />
NANA HAZAAR TARHA JAFA KI LAEENO NE, KHAIMO ME AAG LAGAADI LAEENO NE</p>

<p>NANA HUI ASEER TUMHAARI NAWASIYAAN, KAUNO MAKAAN ME CHAA GAYI GHAM KI UDAASIYAAN<br />
NANA HARAM HUSSAIN KE BAZAAR ME GAYE, HUM SAR BAREHNA KUFE KE DARBAR ME GAYE</p>

<p>NANA TUMHAARI AAL GAYI MULKE SHAAM ME, POHNCHI ALI KI BETIYAAN DARBAARE AAM ME<br />
NANA HAQEER SAAHIB E TATHEER HOGAYE,HAM LOG SHAHR E SHAAM MAIN TASHHEER HOGAYE</p>

<p>NANA ASEER BARA THE HUM EK THI RASAN, BAANDHE GAYE THAI MISLE GUNAAHGAAR E KHASTATAN</p>

<p>NANA HUM APNE HAAL PE ROTE THE ZAAR ZAAR, NANA HAMAARE ROONE PE HASTE THE BAD SHAIAAR</p>

<p>NANA AJEEB HAAL HAMAARAA THA US GHADI, EK BIBI PICHHE DUSRI BIBI KE CHUPTI THI<br />
US WAQT THARTHARI SI MERE TAN ME PAD GAYI, SAD HAIF HAI ZAMMEN MAIN ZAINAB NA GHAD GAYI</p>

<p>ITNE ME EK SHAAMI NAI NANA GHAZAB KIYA, SAIDANI KU KANEEZI MAIN APNI TALAB KIYA<br />
HOTI THI LAAKH ZILLATEN HUM DEKHTE RAHE, HANS HANS KE TAAZIYAANE SITAM JHELTE RAHE</p>

<p>NANAA TABAAH HOKE HAM AAYE HAIN SHAAM SE, EK DAAGHE NAU SAKINA KA LAAYE HAI SHAAM SE<br />
NANA HAMARE TAN PE NISHAANO KO DEKH LO, AB TAK HAI NEEL RASSI KE SHAANON KO DEKH LO</p>

<p>ZAINAB DIKHA KAI SHANOON KU JAB KARRAHI THI BAYAAN, THARAA RAHAA THA ROUZAE SULTAANE MASHRAQAIN<br />
BAS KHATM KAR NASHAR YE GHAMNAAK DAASTAAN, ROTE HAIN IS ALAM MAIN ZAMEEN AUR AASMAAN</p>
</p>